Assets in public directory cannot be imported from JavaScript.
If you intend to import that asset, put the file in the src directory, and use /src/locales/en.ftl?raw instead of /public/locales/en.ftl?raw.
If you intend to use the URL of that asset, use /locales/en.ftl?url&raw.
Assets in public directory cannot be imported from JavaScript.
If you intend to import that asset, put the file in the src directory, and use /src/locales/ko.ftl?raw instead of /public/locales/ko.ftl?raw.
If you intend to use the URL of that asset, use /locales/ko.ftl?url&raw.
